### ChamPlus API Manual Test Suite
### Usage:
### 1. Run the backend server: python manage.py runserver
### 2. Use the "Run" button in IntelliJ/VS Code to execute requests
### 3. Variables are stored in the environment file (http-client.env.json) or defined here.
###    For this file, we use @variable syntax for simplicity.

@host = http://localhost:8000
@tenant_host = http://testtenant.localhost:8000
@admin_email = admin@test.com
@admin_password = password
@member_email = member@test.com
@member_password = password

### ============================================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================================================

### 1.1 Login (Get Tokens)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "{{admin_password}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.access);
    client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh);
%}

### 1.2 Refresh Token
POST {{host}}/api/token/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

### 1.3 Login with 2FA (Step 1)
# @name login_2fa
POST {{host}}/api/security/login-2fa/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "{{admin_password}}"
}

### 1.4 Verify 2FA OTP (Step 2)
# Replace '123456' with the actual OTP sent to email/console
POST {{host}}/api/security/verify-otp/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### ============================================================================
### 2. TENANTS & GROUPS
### ============================================================================

### 2.1 Register New Tenant & Group
POST {{host}}/api/tenants/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_name": "Demo Tenant",
  "subdomain": "demo",
  "group_name": "Demo Chama",
  "admin_email": "demo@admin.com",
  "admin_password": "password123",
  "admin_first_name": "Demo",
  "admin_last_name": "Admin"
}

### 2.2 List My Groups
GET {{tenant_host}}/api/groups/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### ============================================================================
### 3. MEMBERSHIP
### ============================================================================

### 3.1 List Members
GET {{tenant_host}}/api/members/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 3.2 Invite Member
POST {{tenant_host}}/api/members/invite/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newmember@test.com",
  "role": "member"
}

### ============================================================================
### 4. FINANCIALS
### ============================================================================

### 4.1 Log Contribution
POST {{tenant_host}}/api/financials/contributions/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": "5000.00",
  "date": "2025-11-22",
  "payment_method": "cash"
}

### 4.2 Log Expense
POST {{tenant_host}}/api/financials/expenses/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": "2000.00",
  "category": "Transport",
  "description": "Transport to meeting",
  "date": "2025-11-22"
}

### 4.3 View Ledger
GET {{tenant_host}}/api/financials/ledger/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4.4 Dashboard Stats
GET {{tenant_host}}/api/financials/dashboard/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### ============================================================================
### 5. LOANS
### ============================================================================

### 5.1 Apply for Loan
# @name apply_loan
POST {{tenant_host}}/api/loans/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": "10000.00",
  "duration_months": 3,
  "purpose": "Emergency"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("loan_id", response.body.id);
%}

### 5.2 Approve Loan (Admin)
POST {{tenant_host}}/api/loans/{{loan_id}}/approve/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 5.3 Disburse Loan (Triggers Approval Workflow)
POST {{tenant_host}}/api/loans/{{loan_id}}/disburse/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### ============================================================================
### 6. APPROVALS (MAKER-CHECKER)
### ============================================================================

### 6.1 List Pending Approvals
GET {{tenant_host}}/api/approvals/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

# @name list_approvals
# Capture the first pending approval ID
# In a real scenario, you'd pick the one you just created

### 6.2 Approve Request (Must be a DIFFERENT admin)
# Replace UUID with the ID from 6.1
POST {{tenant_host}}/api/approvals/<APPROVAL_ID>/approve/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### ============================================================================
### 7. PAYMENTS
### ============================================================================

### 7.1 Initiate Stripe Payment
POST {{tenant_host}}/api/payments/initiate/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "stripe",
  "amount": "100.00",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 7.2 Initiate MTN Payment
POST {{tenant_host}}/api/payments/initiate/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "mtn",
  "amount": "5000.00",
  "currency": "RWF",
  "phone_number": "250788123456"
}

### 7.3 Initiate Bank Transfer (Manual)
# Note: File upload is tricky in .http files. 
# Usually requires multipart/form-data boundary manually or IDE support.
POST {{tenant_host}}/api/payments/initiate/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="provider"

bank_transfer
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="amount"

15000.00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="currency"

RWF
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="proof_of_payment"; filename="proof.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

(Simulated File Content)
--WebAppBoundary--

### ============================================================================
### 8. SECURITY & AUDIT
### ============================================================================

### 8.1 View Audit Logs
GET {{tenant_host}}/api/security/audit-logs/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
